<h1>Bruce Leon</h1>
<p>City Treasurer, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Filed nominating petitions on Oct. 19, 2026 to challenge Treasurer Melissa Conyears-Ervin. No campaign website or platform found.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Businessman who founded TandemHR, a Westchester-based HR outsourcing company, in 1997 and sold it in 2020; 50th Ward Democratic Committeeperson and a board member of Arie Crown Hebrew Day School. Finished second of four in the 2024 Chicago Board of Education race for District 2, and launched a 2026 campaign for Illinois&#39; 9th Congressional District that he left in January 2026.</p>
